        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Use the local store for what only it can give you.</strong> Ten
            minutes on the floor model — walking, running, incline, deck edges, noise, console and
            fold — tells you more than any listing, and the right questions about delivery, service
            and warranty labour decide how the purchase goes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Then negotiate on extras as well as price, and compare the delivered, assembled figure with
            <a href="/treadmills-for-sale/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">other places to buy</a>.
            Close on price with better service usually means buy local.
          </p>
        </div>
